~ charles_start
Charles: Tic Tac Toe is my favorite game.
- Oh, my god, me too !
	=> charles_launch_game
- Ok
	Charles: Do you want to play a game with me ?
	- Why not ?
		=> charles_launch_game
	- No
		Charles: Oh... That's okay... Maybe another time...
=> END

~ charles_launch_game
Charles: Yippee, good luck to you !
$> MainCommunicator.send_signal_to_main(MainCommunicator.SignalType.ADD_MINIGAME, [load("res://src/minigames/tic_tac_toe/tic_tac_toe.tscn"), {"computer_playstyle":0}])
=> END

~ bob_start
Bob: I wanna become as strong as my big sibling Jeffrey.
- What ?
	Bob: Nobody has ever beaten Jeffrey at tic tac toe.
- Why ?
	Bob: Because they're the best tic tac toe player around !
- You're already pretty strong !
	Bob: You really think that ?
Bob: Will you help me train ?
- Yes
	Bob: Yay
	=> bob_launch_game
- Sorry, but I'm busy
	Bob: That's okay, maybe another time
=> END

~ bob_launch_game
Bob: Good luck to you !
$> MainCommunicator.send_signal_to_main(MainCommunicator.SignalType.ADD_MINIGAME, [load("res://src/minigames/tic_tac_toe/tic_tac_toe.tscn"), {"computer_playstyle":2}])
=> END

~ jeffrey_start
Jeffrey: Hey
- Good morning
- Good afternoon
- Hey
Jeffrey: Do you like tictactoe ?
- Yesss
	Jeffrey: Do you think you can beat me ?
	- Certain
		Jeffrey: A ballzy statement, I like it !
		=> jeffrey_launch_game
	- Pretty sure
		Jeffrey: Let's see what'cha got !
		=> jeffrey_launch_game
	- No
		Jeffrey: That's a shame...
- Not that much
	Jeffrey: sigh...
	Jeffrey: So uncultured...
=> END

~ jeffrey_launch_game
Jeffrey: But, I'll warn you, I'm not like Charles nor Bob ! I play for real !
$> MainCommunicator.send_signal_to_main(MainCommunicator.SignalType.ADD_MINIGAME, [load("res://src/minigames/tic_tac_toe/tic_tac_toe.tscn"), {"computer_playstyle":3}])
=> END